    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Spaceship Down</i>, you play as Noah, an unlucky junior tech stranded on the derelict ship <i>Clementine</i> after a catastrophic crash. Severely injured, you must use every scrap, tool, and clever workaround to navigate the wreckage, rigging makeshift repairs in a desperate bid for survival. Guided by a witty narrator and a chipper AI, <i>AURA</i>, your journey is part escape room, part space mystery, with challenges that balance humour and tension. Solve puzzles, piece together the ship\u2019s secrets, and try to stay alive\u2014before the <i>Clementine</i> decides you\u2019re just another bit of space junk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely explorable ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of easter eggs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story driven gameplay\u00a0</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Spaceship Down</i>, you play as Noah, an unlucky junior tech stranded on the derelict ship <i>Clementine</i> after a catastrophic crash. Severely injured, you must use every scrap, tool, and clever workaround to navigate the wreckage, rigging makeshift repairs in a desperate bid for survival. Guided by a witty narrator and a chipper AI, <i>AURA</i>, your journey is part escape room, part space mystery, with challenges that balance humour and tension. Solve puzzles, piece together the ship\u2019s secrets, and try to stay alive\u2014before the <i>Clementine</i> decides you\u2019re just another bit of space junk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely explorable ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of easter eggs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story driven gameplay\u00a0</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In Spaceship Down, you\u2019re Noah, a stranded tech patching up a crashed spaceship with whatever you can find. With only a sarcastic narrator and a perky AI for company, survival means thinking fast and jury-rigging your way out of a bad situation. Think you\u2019re up for it?",
